{"name":"Too Hot to Handle","hex":"#bf6153","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"too hot to handle","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["An individual or situation that is too dangerous, difficult, or extreme that others do not wish to be involved with."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/too_hot_to_handle"}],"entries":[{"title":"Too Hot to Handle (1938 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Too Hot to Handle, also known as Let 'Em All Talk, is a 1938 comedy-drama directed by Jack Conway and starring Clark Gable, Myrna Loy, and Walter Pidgeon. The plot concerns a newsreel reporter, the female aviator he is attracted to and his fierce competitor. Many of the comedy gags were devised by an uncredited Buster Keaton."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Too_Hot_to_Handle_%281938_film%29_Poster.jpg/330px-Too_Hot_to_Handle_%281938_film%29_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Too_Hot_to_Handle_(1938_film)"},{"title":"Too Hot to Handle (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Too Hot to Handle is a British reality television dating game show produced by Fremantle production companies Talkback and Thames. Created by Laura Gibson and Charlie Bennett, the show's eight-episode first series was released on Netflix on 17 April 2020. Hosted by a virtual assistant named \"Lana\", the show revolves around a group of adults, who are placed together in a house while being forbidden from any kissing, sexual contact or masturbation, with the prize money getting reduced any time a rule is broken."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Too_Hot_to_Handle_title_card.png/330px-Too_Hot_to_Handle_title_card.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Too_Hot_to_Handle_(TV_series)"},{"title":"Handle","blocks":[{"text":"A handle is a part of, or an attachment to, an object that allows it to be grasped and manipulated by hand. The design of each type of handle involves substantial ergonomic issues, even where these are dealt with intuitively or by following tradition. Handles for tools are an important part of their function, enabling the user to exploit the tools to maximum effect. Package handles allow for convenient carrying of packages."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Tsuka.JPG/330px-Tsuka.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Handle"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Too_Hot_to_Handle_%281938_film%29_Poster.jpg/500px-Too_Hot_to_Handle_%281938_film%29_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Too_Hot_to_Handle_%281938_film%29_Poster.jpg/1280px-Too_Hot_to_Handle_%281938_film%29_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Too_Hot_to_Handle_%281938_film%29_Poster.jpg/500px-Too_Hot_to_Handle_%281938_film%29_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AToo_Hot_to_Handle_(1938_film)_Poster.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Too_Hot_to_Handle_title_card.png/500px-Too_Hot_to_Handle_title_card.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Too_Hot_to_Handle_title_card.png/1280px-Too_Hot_to_Handle_title_card.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Too_Hot_to_Handle_title_card.png/500px-Too_Hot_to_Handle_title_card.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&u